'''Protective Poncho''' (Japanese: '''まもりのポンチョ''' ''Protective Poncho'') is an {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Pokémon Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=As long as the Pokémon this card is attached to is on your Bench, prevent all damage done to that Pokémon by your opponent's attacks and {{TCG|Ability|Abilities}}.
}}

